#. TRANSLATORS: The title of an in-game teaching objective
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/building_spaces.lua:25
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/building_spaces.lua:38
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/building_spaces.lua:49
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/init.lua:153
msgid "Building Spaces"
msgstr "建筑空间"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/building_spaces.lua:31
msgid "We will want to place buildings so that we can produce wares."
msgstr "我们要放置建筑，才能生产物品。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/building_spaces.lua:32
msgid "So, let’s find out where we have space for them."
msgstr "那就先看看哪里有地方放。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/building_spaces.lua:33
msgid "Click on the ‘Show / Hide’ menu."
msgstr "点击「显示 / 隐藏」菜单。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/building_spaces.lua:44
msgid "Select ‘Show Building Spaces’."
msgstr "选择「显示建筑空间」。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/building_spaces.lua:54
msgid "Now we can see where it is possible to place buildings and flags."
msgstr "现在可以看到哪些地方能放建筑和旗帜了。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/building_spaces.lua:55
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/welcome.lua:26
msgid "Click ‘OK’ to continue."
msgstr "点击「确定」继续。"

#. TRANSLATORS: The title of an in-game teaching objective
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/flags.lua:60
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/flags.lua:72
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/flags.lua:83
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/init.lua:168
msgid "Flags"
msgstr "旗帜"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/flags.lua:63
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/logs.lua:122
msgid "Your carriers can transport your wares faster if they share the load."
msgstr "多个搬运工分担运输，物品就能运得更快。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/flags.lua:64
msgid "Click on the flag symbol."
msgstr "点击旗帜标记。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/flags.lua:75
msgid "Click on the flag button."
msgstr "点击旗帜按钮。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/flags.lua:86
msgid "Now check if you can place even more flags on your roads."
msgstr "再看看路上还能不能多插几面旗帜。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/flags.lua:87
msgid "Click ‘OK’ when you’re done."
msgstr "弄好后点击「确定」。"

#. TRANSLATORS: The title of an in-game teaching objective
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/init.lua:142
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "欢迎"

#. TRANSLATORS: The title of an in-game teaching objective
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/init.lua:147
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/objectives.lua:22
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/objectives.lua:35
msgid "Objectives"
msgstr "目标"

#. TRANSLATORS: The title of an in-game teaching objective
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/init.lua:158
msgid "Logs & Roads"
msgstr "原木与道路"

#. TRANSLATORS: The title of an in-game teaching objective
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/init.lua:163
msgid "Rocks"
msgstr "岩石"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/logs.lua:115
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/rocks.lua:115
msgid ""
"Click on a small, medium or big building space, then select the building "
"from the small buildings tab."
msgstr "点击一处小型、中型或大型建筑空间，然后在小型建筑标签页里选择建筑。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/logs.lua:117
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/rocks.lua:117
msgid ""
"Click on a medium or big building space, then select the building from the "
"medium buildings tab."
msgstr "点击一处中型或大型建筑空间，然后在中型建筑标签页里选择建筑。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/logs.lua:119
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/rocks.lua:119
msgid ""
"Click on a big building space, then select the building from the big "
"buildings tab."
msgstr "点击一处大型建筑空间，然后在大型建筑标签页里选择建筑。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/logs.lua:122
msgid ""
"If you hold down the ‘Ctrl’ key while clicking on the second flag, this will"
" also place more flags on your road if possible."
msgstr "点击第二面旗帜时按住 Ctrl 键，还能在这条路上尽量多插几面旗帜。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/logs.lua:125
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/logs.lua:175
msgid "Logs"
msgstr "原木"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/logs.lua:128
msgid ""
"You need to supply your tribe with logs. Please build the following "
"building:"
msgstr "你得为部族提供原木。请建造下面这座建筑："

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/logs.lua:138
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/logs.lua:149
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/logs.lua:161
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/rocks.lua:141
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/rocks.lua:152
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/rocks.lua:163
msgid "Roads"
msgstr "道路"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/logs.lua:141
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/rocks.lua:144
msgid "Click on the flag in front of the building to start placing a road."
msgstr "点击建筑门前的旗帜，开始修路。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/logs.lua:152
msgid ""
"Click on the ‘Build road’ button, then and click on the indicated flag."
msgstr "点击「修路」按钮，然后点击指示的那面旗帜。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/logs.lua:164
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/rocks.lua:166
msgid "Click on the building’s button…"
msgstr "点击该建筑的按钮……"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/logs.lua:166
msgid "…then click on the flag in front of the target building."
msgstr "……然后点击目标建筑门前的旗帜。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/logs.lua:178
msgid ""
"Well done! We will soon start producing logs, which we will need for "
"building more buildings."
msgstr "做得好！我们很快就能产出原木，建造更多建筑就靠它了。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/objectives.lua:38
msgid "Open the Objectives window"
msgstr "打开目标窗口"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/objectives.lua:39
#, lua-format
msgid ""
"Click on the button that the arrow is pointing to, or press ‘%s’ to see the "
"current game's objectives."
msgstr "点击箭头所指的按钮，或按「%s」查看本局的目标。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/objectives.lua:45
msgid "Close this window"
msgstr "关闭本窗口"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/objectives.lua:47
msgid "Closing this window"
msgstr "关闭本窗口"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/objectives.lua:48
msgid ""
"You can open and close this window by clicking on the ‘Objectives’ button in"
" the toolbar on the bottom of the screen."
msgstr "点击屏幕底部工具栏上的「目标」按钮，即可打开或关闭本窗口。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/objectives.lua:49
msgid ""
"Like any other window, you can also close the ‘Objectives’ window by right-"
"clicking on it."
msgstr "和其他窗口一样，在「目标」窗口上单击右键也能关闭它。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/rocks.lua:122
msgid ""
"While you do that, check the markers to make the road as flat as possible:"
msgstr "修路时留意这些标记，尽量让路面平缓："

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/rocks.lua:123
msgid ""
"The terrain is flat here. Your carriers will be very swift on this terrain."
msgstr "此处地势平坦，搬运工在这样的地形上走得很快。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/rocks.lua:124
msgid ""
"There is a small slope to climb to reach this field. This means that your "
"workers will be faster walking downhill than they will be walking uphill."
msgstr "要到这块地需要爬一小段坡。也就是说，工人下坡比上坡走得快。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/rocks.lua:125
msgid ""
"The connection between the fields is extremely steep. The speed increase in "
"one direction is huge while the slowdown in the other is also substantial."
msgstr "两块地之间极为陡峭。一个方向上提速很多，另一个方向上减速也同样明显。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/rocks.lua:128
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/rocks.lua:176
msgid "Granite"
msgstr "花岗岩"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/rocks.lua:131
msgid ""
"You need to supply your tribe with granite. Please build the following "
"building:"
msgstr "你得为部族提供花岗岩。请建造下面这座建筑："

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/rocks.lua:155
msgid ""
"Click on the ‘Build road’ button. Afterwards, click the colored markers on "
"the map to guide your road until you reach the flag in front of the target "
"building."
msgstr "点击「修路」按钮，然后依次点击地图上的彩色标记来引导道路，直到抵达目标建筑门前的旗帜。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/rocks.lua:168
msgid ""
"…then click the colored markers on the map to guide your road until you "
"reach the flag in front of the target building."
msgstr "……然后依次点击地图上的彩色标记来引导道路，直到抵达目标建筑门前的旗帜。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/rocks.lua:179
msgid ""
"Well done! We will soon start producing granite, which we will need for "
"building more buildings."
msgstr "做得好！我们很快就能产出花岗岩，建造更多建筑就靠它了。"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/welcome.lua:20
#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/welcome.lua:24
msgid "Welcome to Widelands!"
msgstr "欢迎来到 Widelands！"

#: ../../../../data/scripting/training_wheels/welcome.lua:25
msgid "Follow the arrows to learn how to play."
msgstr "跟着箭头，学习怎么玩。"
